+  <title>Events | Marginalia Books</title>
+  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
+  <header class="site-header">
+    <div class="header-inner">
+      <p class="site-name"><a href="index.html">Marginalia Books</a></p>
+      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main">
+        <ul>
+          <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
+          <li><a href="books.html">Books</a></li>
+          <li><a href="events.html" aria-current="page">Events</a></li>
+          <li><a href="visit.html">Visit</a></li>
+        </ul>
+      </nav>
+    </div>
+  </header>
+
+  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
+    <h1>Events</h1>
+    <p>Most events are free and take place in the back room, which seats about thirty. Doors open fifteen minutes before each event. Children are welcome at every event unless the description says otherwise.</p>
+
+    <ol class="event-list">
+      <li class="event">
+        <p class="event-when"><time datetime="2026-11-28">Saturday, 28 November 2026</time> <span class="event-time">10:30 to 11:30</span></p>
+        <h2>Winter Reading Circle</h2>
+        <p>An informal morning where members bring one book they are enjoying this season and talk about it over tea. New readers are always welcome, and there is no homework.</p>
+      </li>
+      <li class="event">
+        <p class="event-when"><time datetime="2026-12-03">Thursday, 3 December 2026</time> <span class="event-time">19:00 to 20:30</span></p>
+        <h2>Poetry Open Mic</h2>
+        <p>Read one of your own poems or a favourite by another writer. Three minutes per reader, a microphone that works most of the time, and a warm room at the end of a cold week.</p>
+      </li>
+      <li class="event">
+        <p class="event-when"><time datetime="2026-12-09">Wednesday, 9 December 2026</time> <span class="event-time">16:00 to 16:45</span></p>
+        <h2>Children's Story Hour</h2>
+        <p>Stories, songs and a picture book read aloud for children aged three to seven. Accompanying adults are asked to stay for the whole session.</p>
+      </li>
+      <li class="event">
+        <p class="event-when"><time datetime="2027-01-14">Thursday, 14 January 2027</time> <span class="event-time">18:30 to 20:00</span></p>
+        <h2>New Year Mystery Club</h2>
+        <p>We discuss one mystery each month and vote on the next. This month's choice is The Tallow Street Affair. Spoilers are only discussed after the first hour.</p>
+      </li>
+      <li class="event">
+        <p class="event-when"><time datetime="2027-02-02">Tuesday, 2 February 2027</time> <span class="event-time">12:30 to 13:30</span></p>
+        <h2>Author Talk: Maps and Mapmakers</h2>
+        <p>Owen Brandt talks about the unfinished streets in Maps of the Unfinished City and answers questions from the audience. Signed copies are available at the till afterwards.</p>
+      </li>
+    </ol>
+  </main>
+
+  <footer class="site-footer">
+    <p>Marginalia Books is a fictional independent bookshop used for this website demo.</p>
+  </footer>
+</body>
+</html>
