+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="utf-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
+  <title>Home | Marginalia Books</title>
+  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>
+  <header class="site-header">
+    <div class="header-inner">
+      <p class="site-name"><a href="index.html">Marginalia Books</a></p>
+      <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Main">
+        <ul>
+          <li><a href="index.html" aria-current="page">Home</a></li>
+          <li><a href="books.html">Books</a></li>
+          <li><a href="events.html">Events</a></li>
+          <li><a href="visit.html">Visit</a></li>
+        </ul>
+      </nav>
+    </div>
+  </header>
+
+  <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
+    <h1>A small bookshop for slow reading</h1>
+    <p class="lead">Marginalia Books is an independent bookshop at 12 Marginalia Row, Ashford Mill. We stock a considered range of fiction, poetry and nonfiction, and we keep the kettle on for anyone who wants to stay a while.</p>
+    <p>Our shelves are chosen by two booksellers who read everything we sell. If you come in looking for something you cannot name, tell us what you liked last and we will find you a few options, with a note in the margin about why each one might suit you.</p>
+
+    <div class="teasers">
+      <section class="teaser" aria-labelledby="teaser-books">
+        <h2 id="teaser-books">Books</h2>
+        <p>Twelve titles across mystery, fantasy, poetry and nonfiction, with a genre filter so you can go straight to what you want.</p>
+        <p><a href="books.html">Browse the catalogue</a></p>
+      </section>
+      <section class="teaser" aria-labelledby="teaser-events">
+        <h2 id="teaser-events">Events</h2>
+        <p>Reading circles, an open mic for poets, a children's story hour and author talks. Most events are free and none need booking.</p>
+        <p><a href="events.html">See what is coming up</a></p>
+      </section>
+      <section class="teaser" aria-labelledby="teaser-visit">
